# Customization

Public customization MUST use only these channels, in this order:

1. Semantic tokens / theme
2. Closed variant props (`intent`, `size`, `appearance` as finite enums)
3. Composition (compound components and documented slots)
4. `className` / slot class on documented nodes (last resort)

Public API MUST NOT expose `sx`, `backgroundColor`, or an arbitrary CSS-in-JS theme object as the primary styling path. Public API MUST NOT allow stripping semantics or keyboard behavior to make styling easier.
